Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:54.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又是他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:58.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell him I'd come to the phone, but my ankles are weighing me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:58.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉他我想去接电话  可是我脚踝太胖走不动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.66,0:20:04.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen. I don't think this is the best time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.66,0:20:04.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着  现在还不是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:06.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, can you do something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:06.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我个忙好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:08.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:08.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:13.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:13.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:17.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Music?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:17.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来点音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:19.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:19.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:29.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The next one's dedicated to Rachel from Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下一首是罗斯要点给瑞秋的歌曲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, he wants you to know he's deeply sorry for what he did
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  他要你知道  他为他的行为深感抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and he hopes you can find it in your heart to forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望你能从心底原谅他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See the stones set in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到你眼若冰霜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See the thorn twist in your side
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到你浑身带刺
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:49.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll wait for you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:49.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会等你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sleight of hand and twist of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上天真爱作弄人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:21:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On a bed of nails she makes me wait
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:21:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她就让我苦苦地等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:07.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'll wait without you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:07.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不论你是否在身旁  我会等你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.15,0:21:12.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've just gotten a call from Rachel and she told us what Ross did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.15,0:21:12.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们刚接到瑞秋的电话  她说了罗斯做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:16.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's pretty appalling. And, Ross, if you're listening...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:16.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真令人发指  罗斯  如果你在听
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I don't want to play your song anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想再放你点的歌了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we devote our time to a couple that stands a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:27.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们何不将时间留给还有机会的情侣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Avery, Michelle's sorry she hit you with her car...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾佛  米雪很抱歉用她的车撞你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:32.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and she hopes you two will work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:32.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她希望你们能够解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a room where
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个房间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.65,0:21:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And tell my secrets to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.65,0:21:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}倾吐心中的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:48.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In my room
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:48.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我房里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.19,0:21:55.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In my room
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.19,0:21:55.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我房里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In my room
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我房里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.97,0:22:09.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for coming in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.97,0:22:09.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你再度光临
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:11.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not at all. I have no morals, and I need the cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:11.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气  我既没道德  又需要钱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.43,0:22:13.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like I'm looking in a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.43,0:22:13.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们真是一模一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.51,0:22:19.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, they're called Fish-tachios.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.51,0:22:19.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个东西叫做开心鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:22.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They taste exactly like pistachios...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:22.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}味道是跟开心果一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:24.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... but they're made of reconstituted fish bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:24.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但主要是用鱼肉重新压制的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:27.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, try one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:27.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来  试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.75,0:22:30.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right. - You're not allergic to anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.75,0:22:30.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好  -你没对什么过敏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.91,0:22:32.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cat hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.91,0:22:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猫毛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.85,0:22:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.85,0:22:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
